* LTC6252 High-Speed Amplifier Gain of 2
.lib LTC6252.lib

* Power Supplies
VCC VCC 0 5
VEE VEE 0 -5

* Input Signal: 1V amplitude sine at 10 MHz, AC 1 for AC analysis
V1 IN 0 SINE(0 1 10Meg) AC 1

* Feedback Network for Non-Inverting Gain of +2 V/V
R1 OUT VN 499
R2 VN 0 499

* Amplifier Instantiation (Standard 5-pin opamp configuration)
X1 IN VN VCC VEE OUT LTC6252

* Analysis Directives
.tran 0 1u
.ac dec 10 1Meg 100Meg

* Measurement for exact gain in dB at 10 MHz
.meas ac gain_db FIND 20*log10(mag(V(OUT)/V(IN))) AT 10Meg

.end
